# Trust: Abquhbah (hidden quest TrustAbquhbah): a level 99 Warrior in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (nation 1, Bastok).
# Abquhbah has his own script (default none). No permit and no mission: the check fails: his script. The Bastok
# Trust Permit (a GM, the permit helper accepts any of the three): Immortal Sentries only current (not completed):
# his script; completed, but RoV not at Ever Forward (none): his script; Ever Forward current: 170 ([1] 1, [2] 1,
# text_table 0). Finished with a full inventory: giveItem fails, no cipher; with room: the cipher. The cipher held:
# the check fails: his script.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Abquhbah/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/170
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=35.5,-6.6,-56.7 job=WAR lvl=99 nation=1
login
trigger Abquhbah                        # no permit: the check fails: his script
finish-if-event
keyitem BastokTrustPermit               # a GM
mission Toau ImmortalSentries current   # a GM
trigger Abquhbah                        # Immortal Sentries not completed: the check fails: his script
finish-if-event
mission Toau ImmortalSentries completed # a GM
trigger Abquhbah                        # RoV below Ever Forward (none): the check fails: his script
finish-if-event
mission Rov EverForward current         # a GM
fill-inventory
trigger Abquhbah                        # 170 ([1] 1, [2] 1)
finish                                  # no room: giveItem fails, no cipher
free-inventory
trigger Abquhbah                        # 170 again
finish                                  # the cipher
trigger Abquhbah                        # the cipher held: the check fails: his script
finish-if-event
